# --- Swiss Ephemeris data files (large binaries, downloaded separately) ---
# Drop the official sepl_*.se1 / seas_*.se1 files into core/ephe/ for full
# precision. The engine falls back to the built-in Moshier ephemeris when
# these files are absent, so this folder is intentionally git-ignored.
core/ephe/*.se1
core/ephe/*.seas
# ...except the bundled Chiron data file, which ships with the app so Chiron
# works fully offline (see core/ephemeris.py auto-discovery). Keep tracked.
!core/ephe/seas_18.se1